{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "090dbeb8-bbf2-85ba-bc09-de8317fdc051",
  "created_at": "2025-12-21T11:48:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gerard Flynn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:36:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City of Newport, Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:36:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good morning. Yes. My name is Gerard Flynn. I am calling for my mother. She lives on Carroll Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:37:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Mr. Flynn. Okay, and what's going on at your mother's place?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:37:17-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The water. It comes in the driveway. Every time it rains hard, the water comes. After the big rain, Wednesday and Thursday, three days ago, it is still there some. I am very tired of this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:37:37-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So the rain Wednesday into Thursday, and you've got water coming into the driveway. Do you know where it's coming from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:37:50-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. At the corner there is the catch basin. The drain in the street. It is full with leaves. Very full. The water cannot go down, so it goes back, and it comes into the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:38:10-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. A catch basin at the corner clogged with leaves, and the water's backing up into the driveway. Let me get the address. What's the number on Carroll?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:38:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Forty-four Carroll Avenue. Forty-four. In the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:38:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Forty-four Carroll Avenue. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:38:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. Forty-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:38:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And the drain you're talking about, is it right in front of the house or down at the corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:38:50-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "At the corner. Not in front. But the street goes down, you understand? The low end of the street is there. All the water goes to the low end, and it stays. It makes a, a pool."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:39:11-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the street slopes and everything collects at the low end by that corner, and your mother's driveway is close to that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:39:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Exactly. The driveway is near the low part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:39:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And is the water in the driveway now, today, or has it gone down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:39:39-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Today it is gone, mostly. But the sidewalk, it is a sheet of mud. Mud and grit, like sand. All over. My mother is old, she walks with care. It is slippery, I am afraid she will fall. Sorry, I say it too strong. But it is not good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:40:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine, that sounds like a real nuisance. So the water went down but left mud and grit on the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:40:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Mud and grit. And the leaves, they are still in the drain. So next rain, same thing again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:40:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Has this happened before, with this same drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:40:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, many times. Every big rain. Nobody comes to clean it. I see the leaves there since the fall. Weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:40:48-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me write that down. Leaves built up at the catch basin at the corner of Carroll, since the fall, backs up with every heavy rain. Did anyone from the city ever come out to look at it, that you know of?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:41:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not know of this. My mother says no. Nobody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:41:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Bear with me one second, I'm just putting this in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:41:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:41:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay. Mr. Flynn, what's the best number to reach you, in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:41:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is four-zero-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:41:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-three. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:41:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:41:52-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Excuse me, one thing. My sister is on the other line. She is trying to get through to a different office, for my mother also. I think it is the phone is busy for her. So if I go quiet, it is because I look at my phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:42:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, you take your time. Do you know which office she's trying to reach?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:42:29-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am not sure. She said maybe the one for the, the building. I do not know the name. I will ask her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:42:42-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's alright. If it's about the drain and the street, that's us here at Public Works. If it's something else, she can call back on a weekday. We're on a weekend schedule today, so some offices aren't picking up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:43:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah. Sunday. Yes, I forget. Okay. So the other office is closed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:43:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Most likely, yes. Tell her not to worry about it today, and she can try Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:43:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I tell her. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:43:25-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Now, back to the drain. I'm putting it in as a request to have the catch basin checked and cleared. I can't tell you exactly when a crew will get out, because after a storm like Wednesday's they're usually backed up with calls."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:43:50-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I understand. But my question is, who do I call to get it checked? Is it you? Or another person? I want to be sure to call the right one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:44:08-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You called the right place. Public Works handles the catch basins and the street drains. So this report goes to the crew that does the drains."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:44:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So you are the one. Good. And if the crew does not come, I call you again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:44:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, you call this same number, weekdays are best, and tell them you already put in a report for forty-four Carroll Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:44:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Forty-four Carroll Avenue. I say that. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:44:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And I'll note that the sidewalk has mud and grit on it, so the crew knows it's not just the drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:45:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. The mud, it is a danger for my mother. Please say this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:45:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that in. Is your mother able to stay inside until it's cleaned up, or does she need to go out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:45:25-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She goes to church, this morning she is already gone. My cousin drove her. But she comes back, and she must walk the sidewalk. So I go there after this call, with a broom and a shovel. I clean what I can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:45:48-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's kind of you. Just be careful of traffic at that low corner, and don't reach into the drain itself. Leave that for the crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:46:02-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, I do not touch the drain. Only the sidewalk. Can you say again, please, the part about the drain? I want to tell my mother correctly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:46:18-05:00",
      "duration": 33,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I've put in a request with Public Works to check and clear the catch basin at the corner by forty-four Carroll Avenue. It's clogged with leaves and backing water into the driveway. A crew will look at it, but I can't give you a day. If nothing happens in a few days, call back and reference this report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:46:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Request, check and clear, corner, forty-four Carroll. A few days, then I call again. Yes, I have it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:47:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Anything else I can help with while I have you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:47:09-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Only one more. If it rains again before the crew comes, and the water is high, what do I do? Is there a number for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:47:24-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If the water's coming into the house or it's an emergency, you'd call 911. For just a backed-up drain, call back here, or the main line on a weekday, and they'll add it to the report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:47:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Not the house, only the driveway, so I call here. Good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:47:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:47:53-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Excuse me. My sister, she is saying she got a person. Not the right office, she says. It is closed message. So you were right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:48:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that sounds about right for a Sunday. She can try again tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:48:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Okay. Thank you very much, Miss Lorraine. You are patient with me. My English, it is slow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:48:27-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Your English is just fine, Mr. Flynn. You gave me everything I needed. Take care going over there with the broom."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:48:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I hope the crew comes soon. Have a good Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-21T11:48:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
  "attachments": [
